  "releaseNotes": "Multitouch: evdev MT protocol B support (ABS_MT_SLOT per-slot contact\n\t\t\ttracking, frame commit on SYN_REPORT, stable per-contact tracking ids).\n\t\t\tSingle-touch emulation is suppressed on MT-slot devices; devices without\n\t\t\tslots keep the previous single-touch behavior. Jitter/tap filtering\n\t\t\tapplies only while one contact is active so pinch gestures get raw\n\t\t\tpoints. SYN_DROPPED cancels all active contacts. Only the primary\n\t\t\tcontact drives the soft cursor.",
